# Variables a developer sets by hand. Copy to `.env` (git-ignored); .envrc loads it.
# `just run` needs none of them. Full list: docs/src/guide/running.md § Environment Variables.

# Required by a deployment whose Lua config has no `jwt_secret` (at least 32 bytes).
# SIPI_JWTKEY=

# Optional: Sentry error reporting.
# SIPI_SENTRY_DSN=
# SIPI_SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=
# SIPI_SENTRY_RELEASE=
